  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Match the type of interaction in column <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> with the distance dependence of their interaction energy in column <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>:</mo></math></p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 300px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>A</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>B</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(i)&nbsp;ion -&nbsp;ion&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>(a)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mi>r</mi></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(ii) Dipole - dipole</td>\t\t\t<td>(b)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>(iii) London dispersion</td>\t\t\t<td>(c)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td>(iv)&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>6</mn></msup></mfrac></math></td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table>"
  },
